<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the National Land Code (Amendment) Act 1995."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@> .
