<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall come into force in each State upon such date as the Minister may, with the approval of the National Land Council, appoint in relation to that State by notification in the Gazette of the Federation, and the Minister may, with the approval of the National Land Council, appoint different dates in respect of different provisions of this Act in relation to that State."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@> .
