<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall come into force in the Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur on such date as the Minister may, by notification in the Gazette, appoint and the Minister may appoint different dates in respect of different provisions of this Act. Amendment"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@> .
