<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 301A of the Code is amended by substituting of section for the words \"has not\" the words \"and, where applicable, 301A. any levy payable under sub-section (2) of section 433B have not\". New section"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@> .
