<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@/~cl_8__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any levy collected in respect of an approval and granted under sub-section (1) of section 433B and any indemnity. rejection of any instrument of dealing for non-payment of the levy by the Land Administrator or by the Registrar of Titles, as the case may be, after 27 October 1995 until the commencement of this Act, which would have been lawful if this Act had been enacted and in force when the collection or rejection was done is hereby declared to have been lawfully collected or done, as the case may be."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@/~cl_8__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@/~cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/40/eng@> .
